@startuml sequence-conditional-jump-m23
title SEQ-04: Conditional Jump Assessment Flow (UC-04 / BF-11)
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Learner" as Learner
boundary "Web Learner Client\n(SCR-L-06 / SCR-L-11)" as Web
control "Jump Service\n(Route Handler / BFF)" as JumpSvc
control "Assessment Service\n(Jump Test Evaluator)" as AssessSvc
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(PostgREST / RLS)" as DB

== 1. Jump Eligibility & Cooldown Check ==
Learner -> Web: Click "Jump to Unit" on locked Unit N (SCR-L-06)
activate Web
Web -> JumpSvc: GET /api/curriculum/jump/eligibility?targetUnitId=unit-N
activate JumpSvc
JumpSvc -> DB: Query recent failed Jump assessment evidence for targetUnitId\n(Evaluates 24h cooldown rule; persistence mechanism OPEN DESIGN)
activate DB
DB --> JumpSvc: Return lastFailedAt timestamp from evidence (or null)
deactivate DB

alt Cooldown Active (now() - lastFailedAt < 24 hours)
    JumpSvc --> Web: 429 Too Many Requests {\n  error: "JUMP_COOLDOWN_ACTIVE",\n  retryAfterHours: remainingHours\n}
    Web --> Learner: Show Cooldown Lockout Modal (Remaining time displayed, Jump disabled)
else Cooldown Cleared / First Attempt
    JumpSvc -> JumpSvc: Determine test size based on skip distance:\n- 1 Unit: 20 items\n- 2-3 Units: 25-30 items\n- >3 Units: 40 items
    JumpSvc --> Web: 200 OK { eligible: true, testItemCount, passThreshold: 0.95 }
    deactivate JumpSvc
    Web --> Learner: Open Jump Assessment Runner (SCR-L-11)
end

== 2. Jump Assessment Execution ==
Learner -> Web: Complete Jump test items and submit
Web -> JumpSvc: POST /api/curriculum/jump/submit {\n  targetUnitId: unit-N,\n  answers: [...] \n}
activate JumpSvc

JumpSvc -> AssessSvc: Grade Jump submission
activate AssessSvc
AssessSvc --> JumpSvc: Return { totalItems, correctItems, scorePercentage }
deactivate AssessSvc

alt PASS: Score >= 95% (Jump Threshold Met)
    JumpSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO "AssessmentResult" (\n  id, userId = auth.uid(), assessmentType = 'DIAGNOSTIC',\n  deliveryMode = 'JUMP', rawScores = JSONB, dimensions = JSONB,\n  stageData = JSONB, languageConfig = JSONB, completedAt = now()\n) [IMMUTABLE EVIDENCE - No persisted score/passed column]
    activate DB
    DB --> JumpSvc: AssessmentResult created

    JumpSvc -> DB: Mark bypassed Units & Lessons as:\n  status = 'SKIPPED_BY_JUMP',\n  by_jump = true\n  (WHERE orderIndex < targetUnit.orderIndex AND status != 'COMPLETED')
    DB --> JumpSvc: Bypassed content updated

    JumpSvc -> DB: Unlock Target Unit N (status = 'IN_PROGRESS' [M2.2 canonical] / 'UNLOCKED' [PROVISIONAL / TARGET])
    DB --> JumpSvc: Target Unit accessible
    deactivate DB

    note right of JumpSvc
        Invariants (E-EXP-03 / ADR-002):
        - Bypassed units hold provenance: SKIPPED_BY_JUMP / UNLOCKED_BY_JUMP (by_jump = true).
        - ZERO COMPLETED_BY_JUMP assigned.
        - ZERO CEFR certification conferred.
    end note

    JumpSvc --> Web: 200 OK {\n  status: "PASSED",\n  scorePercentage: scorePercentage,\n  targetUnitId: "unit-N" (unlocked [PROVISIONAL / TARGET])\n}
    Web --> Learner: Celebration Modal -> Redirect to accessible Unit N path (IN_PROGRESS)

else FAIL: Score < 95% (Jump Threshold Not Met)
    JumpSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO "AssessmentResult" (\n  id, userId = auth.uid(), assessmentType = 'DIAGNOSTIC',\n  deliveryMode = 'JUMP', rawScores = JSONB, stageData = JSONB,\n  completedAt = now()\n) [IMMUTABLE AUDIT TRAIL for 24h Cooldown Rule - No lastJumpFailedAt column on LearnerProfile]
    activate DB
    DB --> JumpSvc: Cooldown evidence recorded
    deactivate DB

    JumpSvc --> Web: 200 OK {\n  status: "FAILED",\n  scorePercentage: scorePercentage,\n  cooldownHours: 24\n}
    deactivate JumpSvc
    Web --> Learner: Display Result Modal:\n- "Chưa đạt ngưỡng nhảy cấp (yêu cầu >= 95%)"\n- Jump locked for 24 hours\n- Continue linear learning on current Unit
end
deactivate Web

@enduml
